    "created_at": "2015-10-07T21:02:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-07T21:19:48Z",
    "body": "So Gecko doesn't have void menuitem, since at some point it wasn't supposed to be such.\nThe idea was that `<menuitem>` should behave closer to `<option>`\n\nBut we do have #ifdef to make `<menuitem>` void.\n",
