    "created_at": "2015-10-07T21:26:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-07T21:26:23Z",
    "body": "The proposal in this issue is closer to `<option>` than Gecko's current implementation, as I understand it, but it is a bit more complicated than void. I can write it up in the spec if Gecko and Blink would rather implement that than implement void. Which would you prefer?\n",
