    "created_at": "2016-01-15T07:35:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-15T07:35:36Z",
    "body": "If I ignore the Apple site issue, I'd like to keep void &lt;menuitem>.\n\nIt's not hard to change the &lt;menuitem> implementation in Blink like &lt;option>.  However allowing child nodes in &lt;menuitem> would confuse web developers.  They might waste time to markup/style text content of &lt;menuitem>, notice that it doesn't work, and report bugs to browser vendors.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
