    "created_at": "2016-01-15T14:16:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-15T14:16:49Z",
    "body": "Gecko has similar handling for menuitem's label as option's label. First check if there is label attribute and use that, otherwise use the text content of the element.\nI like that consistency between option and menuitem.\nFiled #519\n\nLooks like the spec about menuitem is still just in some random state which no one implements.\n",
