    "updated_at": "2016-02-05T11:35:00Z",
    "body": "There is a long Bugzilla bug on the same issue from 2014:\nhttps://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=25325\n\nI'm closing it in favor of this issue, but whoever attempts to fix should should have a look to see if there's any new (well, old) information.\n",
