    "created_at": "2016-03-17T03:45:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-17T03:45:52Z",
    "body": "Google Chrome 49 stable has counters for menuitem.\n\n&lt;menuitem> appears in 0.075% of all page views.\nhttps://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/1104\n\n&lt;/menuitem> appears in 0.075% of all page views.\nhttps://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/1105\n\nFrom the internal raw data, 99.87% of pages with &lt;menuitem> has &lt;/menuitem>.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
